<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #f3ecf4;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "SimSun", sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .page {
    position: relative;
    width: 760px;
    background: #fbf7fb;
    border: 3px dashed #b9a7c0;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 30px 35px 45px 35px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  /* bunting flags */
  .bunting {
    position: absolute;
    top: -6px;
    right: 40px;
    width: 260px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .flag {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 15px solid transparent;
    border-right: 15px solid transparent;
    border-top: 30px solid;
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
  .flag:nth-child(1){border-top-color:#7ec8e3;}
  .flag:nth-child(2){border-top-color:#f4d35e;}
  .flag:nth-child(3){border-top-color:#f28c8c;}
  .flag:nth-child(4){border-top-color:#8ecae6;}
  .flag:nth-child(5){border-top-color:#f4a259;}
  .flag:nth-child(6){border-top-color:#a3c9a8;}

  .bg-watermark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 30px;
    right: 30px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #e3d5e8;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: right;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .unit-tag {
    background: linear-gradient(#f6b93b,#e58e26);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px 8px 8px 0;
    border: 2px solid #d9770c;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .title-box {
    background: #4aa8d8;
    border: 2px solid #2f7fb0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 30px;
    flex-grow: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .title-box .main-title {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .title-box .sub-title {
    color: #eaf6ff;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    column-gap: 30px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .columns::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    border-left: 2px dashed #cbb8d1;
  }

  .col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .section {
    position: relative;
  }
  .arrow-label {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 8px 26px 8px 16px;
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 88% 0, 100% 50%, 88% 100%, 0 100%);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .section p {
    margin: 4px 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #333;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .c-blue   { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#5aa9dd,#7fc1ea); }
  .c-green1 { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#5aa85a,#7fc47f); }
  .c-green2 { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#6fa93f,#95c766); }
  .c-orange { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#f0a93c,#f6c667); }
  .c-purple { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#8a6bb1,#a98fca); }
  .c-red    { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#e0616b,#ec8a92); }

  .staple {
    width: 30px;
    height: 12px;
    border: 2px solid #bbb;
    border-top: none;
    border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
    margin: 6px auto 0;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .blank-line {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 90px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #555;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="bunting">
    <div class="flag"></div>
    <div class="flag"></div>
    <div class="flag"></div>
    <div class="flag"></div>
    <div class="flag"></div>
    <div class="flag"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-watermark">[illegible watermark text]</div>

  <div class="header-row">
    <div class="unit-tag">第七单元</div>
    <div class="title-box">
      <div class="main-title">学习任务群设计</div>
      <div class="sub-title">学习动态描写和静态描写</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="columns">
    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
    <div class="col">

      <div class="section">
        <div class="arrow-label c-blue">21 古诗词三首</div>
        <p>抓住古诗中静态描写和动态描写想象画面，如《山居秋暝》一诗中，静态描写："明月松间照"。动态描写："清泉石上流""竹喧归浣女"莲舟下渔舟。这首诗以动衬静，写出了山间傍晚的幽静。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="staple"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="arrow-label c-green2">23 鸟的天堂</div>
        <p>第一次去"鸟的天堂"，作者抓住大榕树的根、干、枝、叶等部位逐项来写，写出了大榕树的茂盛和充满活力，是静态描写。</p>
        <p>第二次去"鸟的天堂"，描写了鸟的活动场面，是动态描写，动静结合，让我们觉得大榕树真的是"鸟的天堂"。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="staple"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="arrow-label c-orange">交流平台</div>
        <p>关注静态描写和动态描写的句子，品味并积累，强化单元语文要素。</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
    <div class="col">

      <div class="section">
        <div class="arrow-label c-green1">22 四季之美</div>
        <p>第1自然段描写春黎明时分的天空，用"鱼肚色、红晕、红紫红衔"写出了天空颜色的变化，用"泛、映、飘"等动词和"一点点一点儿、微微的"等叠词写出了天空颜色变化的过程。第2自然段描写夏夜萤火虫飞舞的迷人情景。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="staple"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="arrow-label c-purple">24* 月迹</div>
        <p>抓住作者对月亮爬行俏格儿的动态描写，以及对满院子玉的、银银的月光的静态描写，会体会月亮动态时的顽皮可爱、静态时的悟静柔美。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="staple"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="arrow-label c-red">词句段运用</div>
        <p>第二题：读下面的例句，体会作者是如何把一个画面写具体的，仿照着写一写。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="staple"></div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="arrow-label c-blue">单元习作</div>
        <p><span class="blank-line"></span>即景</p>
        <p>习作内容：观察一种自然现象或一处自然景观，重点观察景物的变化，写下观察所得。根据自己的观察对象，把题目补充完整，如"雨中即景""日落即景""田野即景""窗外即景"。</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
